{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんなーこ(*⌒▽⌒*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日の、1周年記念アニバーサリーライブ楽しんでいただけましたか?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"欅の木のの装飾や大きなケーキ、トロッコ、シャボン玉などなど演出や装飾がとってもかわいくてリハーサルらテンションがあがっていました!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大人は信じんてくれない の炎の演出もすごかった!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして昨日は、エキセントリックの衣装、ダンスが初披露でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"エキセントリックはとーーっても動きやすい靴と服ですごく好きな衣装です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぶかぶかしてる服好きです!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ダンスも、とても特徴的で、靴を使ったりや髪ゴムを取ったりなどすごくエキセントリックです!笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぜひ、全国握手でみてほしいです!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、明日の握手会もたのしみです(*ˊᗜˋ*)/♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個握〜!\n募集始めます 壁|ω・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ!\n明日の握手会は、\nこれ見に来てほしいです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN3MSJDMHJNQJMNVWHG7DQ4","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n飴細工。\n姉と母と作りました!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私が作ったのは、"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN3MVHP5ZWY3FMYTYHR0EAC","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\nこの3体!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"左側は、母。右側は、姉。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日持っていきます!"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN3N6606BMEAQT2K58M86PB","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自信作。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN3N7WHPSAKF31ADW3J8E93","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"桜も見に行きました。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN3N943D5AVYF7F69J7FWJT","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n満開*❀٭"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ご飯も一緒に!"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN3NAAZQ232APCAFEKY1TK1","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\nカルパッチョ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN3ND8W7A2VJKA779Y3KHG4","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\nおにく。\n久しぶりに家族で幸せでした＼(⊃‐^)/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"飴細工、頑張ったので見に来てね!\n読んでくれてありがとうございました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⊿長沢菜々香⊿"}],"source":"archive"}